CORE
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract f _ --no-assertions
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[f\.postcondition\.\d+\] line 2 Check ensures clause.*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
The check of a contract's ensures clause (here f returns x + 1, not x + 2)
is not one of the user's assertions: --no-assertions keeps it.
